    "action(n10, \"If the Items are repaired and added into inventory, we continue the process.\")",
    "action(n11, \"if the Items can't be repaired and are discarded, we email the customer with replacement charges.\")",
    "action(n12, \"Email customer with replacement charges\")",
    "action(n13, \"Lastly, the items are packed for an existing order. If the Items are packed for an existing order, we continue the process. If the Items are stored for future orders, we also continue the process.\")",
    "branch(b5, XOR)",
    "action(n14, \"The customer is then emailed with replacement charges, and the process is complete.\")",
    "action(n15, \"Finally, when the process is complete, it ends.\")",
